        "name": "Thalamus TC-TRN Loop - Fast Testing (Izhikevich)",
        "description": "Neuron model: IZHIKEVICH (dt=1.0ms). Thalamocortical relay + reticular nucleus loop: 60% excitatory TC relay, 40% inhibitory TRN. Strongly depressing STP (U=0.6, Gil 1997). Slow GABA-A (12ms) for spindle-like oscillations. NMDA disabled (thalamic synapses are primarily AMPA-mediated). Supports tonic and burst firing modes.",
